   targets:{MS2:2,MS3:3,LDAC:4,commission:4},
   why:"ROTC labs, LDAC, and field exercises all feature obstacle courses. The combination of climbing, swinging, and crawling under load is not captured by any existing skill.",
   howTo:"Build grip strength and pull capability first. Walk each obstacle slowly before running it. Focus on technique over speed initially — a bad fall is costlier than a slow run.",
   safety:"All obstacle courses are run under cadre supervision. Never attempt unstable or damaged obstacles. Inspect each obstacle before use.",
