   levels:[
     "Stand up a fresh Linux VM, configure users and permissions, and write a cron job that runs a script automatically","Write a Bash script that parses log files and emails a summary; runs without errors on a clean system","Configure a multi-VLAN network in a home lab with routing between VLANs","Deploy a containerized application with Docker Compose; application stays up through a host reboot","Configure a cloud VPC (AWS/Azure/GCP) with subnets, security groups, and an internet gateway from scratch","Write Terraform or Bicep that provisions a complete environment; infrastructure is reproducible with one command","Design and implement a CI/CD pipeline that builds, tests, and deploys an application automatically","Configure centralized logging and alerting; alert fires for a real event you simulate","Harden a Linux system to CIS Benchmark Level 1; document every change and why","Manage a Kubernetes cluster with multiple deployments, persistent storage, and rolling updates","Architect a cloud-native environment for a team of 10: networking, IAM, logging, CI/CD, cost controls, and security posture documented"],
