   unlockHint:"This card feeds the Data Structures & Algorithms Rare.",
   why:"Sorting and searching are the most frequently used algorithmic operations in real software. Knowing which algorithm to choose — and being able to implement it from memory — is a baseline CS competence.",
   howTo:"Implement each sort from scratch without looking it up. Then solve real search problems. LeetCode 'Binary Search' tag is the fastest path to fluency.",
