   advance:["Reach L1: hand-trace one FCFS/SJF schedule correctly against a worked answer.","Reach L2: correctly trace 5 scheduling problems across 2+ algorithms in a row.","Reach L3: trace a 5-process Round Robin/Priority schedule with correct wait/turnaround times within 5 minutes.","Reach L4: build a scheduling simulator in code that matches textbook outputs on 3 problem sets."],
