   advance:["Reach L1: baseline all five dimensions documented.","Reach L2: L3+ in both speed skills.","Reach L3: L3+ in both memory skills; 20-item palace.","Reach L4: L3+ attention+reading; 15 min/day habit.","Reach L5: L3+ math+pattern; measurable speed gain.","Reach L6: L3+ critical thinking+decision; argument under pressure.","Reach L7: L5+ in two dimensions simultaneously.","Reach L8: L5+ in four dimensions under full load.","Reach L9: stress test within 10% of rested.","Reach L10: L7+ three dimensions; periodized training.","Reach L11: 30-day peak + teach+document.","Reach L12: field-conditions full-day sustained.","Reach L13: L8+ two dimensions top-decile benchmarks.","Reach L14: 6-month sustained top-5% one benchmark."],
