   "Complete all recurring ROTC and school administrative requirements on time for a semester with no reminders from others",
   "Build a document management system (digital or physical) where every key record can be located in under 2 minutes",
   "File taxes accurately and on time; understand what forms and deductions apply to your situation",
   "Navigate at least one non-routine government service (VA, DFAS, GI Bill, DMV for a new state) without outside help",
   "Complete all legal literacy basics: understand your lease, your insurance, and what to do if stopped by police or involved in an accident",
   "Run a full year of administrative life — taxes, renewals, ROTC records, insurance, school — with zero administrative failures",
