   unlockHint:"This card feeds the Signal Planning Rare.",
   why:"A PACE plan (Primary, Alternate, Contingency, Emergency) is what keeps a mission's communications from having a single point of failure — planning it before the mission, not improvising it after the radio dies, is the whole point.",
   howTo:"Practice drafting PACE plans for practice missions, identifying realistic primary and backup methods appropriate to the scenario's equipment and terrain.",
