   levels:["Resolve 3 stacked record requests correctly during one duty day","Resolve 5 stacked record requests correctly in a single duty day averaging under 3 minutes each","Resolve 8 stacked record requests correctly in a single duty day with no request taking over 5 minutes","Resolve 10+ stacked requests correctly in one duty day with a same-day log confirmed by a supervisor"],
