   roadmap:["1 record, unfamiliar system", "3 records, 7 min each", "5 records, 5 min each", "Full-day custodian coverage"],
   advance:["Reach L1: locate one record in an unfamiliar system within 10 minutes, no orientation.","Reach L2: locate 3 records in an unfamiliar system within 7 minutes each.","Reach L3: locate 5 records in an unfamiliar system within 5 minutes each.","Reach L4: cover an absent custodian's system for a full duty day, resolving every request correctly."],
