   unlockHint:"This card feeds the Pattern Recognition in Operations Rare.",
   why:"Experienced operators aren't smarter in the moment — they've built a larger library of recognized patterns from past scenarios. Deliberately cataloging patterns instead of leaving them as vague gut feelings is what makes the library usable and teachable.",
