   unlockHint:"This card feeds the Pattern Recognition in Operations Rare.",
   why:"Recognizing a pattern is only useful if it lets you predict what's likely to happen next. Turning a recognized pattern into a concrete, testable prediction is what separates real pattern recognition from just noticing a coincidence.",
