   levels:["Deliver an accurate one-sentence summary within 10 seconds on one scenario, checked against a key","Repeat correctly on 5 different scenarios in a row","Deliver an accurate summary within 10 seconds that a reviewer rates as clear and complete on 5 scenarios","Deliver an accurate 10-second summary in a live or field scenario, confirmed by an observer, 3 separate times"],
   roadmap:["1 scenario correct","5 scenarios in a row","5 scenarios, reviewer-rated","3 live summaries"],
   advance:["Reach L1: deliver an accurate one-sentence summary within 10 seconds on one scenario, checked against a key.","Reach L2: repeat correctly on 5 different scenarios in a row.","Reach L3: deliver an accurate summary within 10 seconds that a reviewer rates as clear and complete on 5 scenarios.","Reach L4: deliver an accurate 10-second summary in a live or field scenario, confirmed by an observer, 3 separate times."],
