   howTo:"Give a numeric confidence rating alongside each assessment at the start of a scenario and again after new information arrives, checking that the confidence rating moved in the correct direction and by a reasonable amount against a key or reviewer.",
   levels:["Give an initial and revised confidence rating that moves in the correct direction on one scenario, checked against a key","Repeat correctly on 3 scenarios in a row","Repeat correctly on 5 scenarios in a row with the revised rating judged reasonable in magnitude by a reviewer","Give a correctly recalibrated confidence rating in a live or field scenario, confirmed by an observer, 3 separate times"],
   roadmap:["1 scenario correct","3 in a row","5 in a row, magnitude-checked","3 live recalibrations"],
