   levels:["Produce a rubric-passing response to one contradiction on one scenario, checked by a reviewer","Repeat rubric-passing responses on 3 scenarios in a row","Repeat rubric-passing responses on 5 scenarios in a row within 15 seconds of the contradiction appearing","Produce a rubric-passing response to a genuine contradiction in a live or field scenario, confirmed by an observer, 3 separate times"],
