   unlockHint:"This card feeds the Body Autonomy & Informed Consent Rare.",
   why:"Real informed consent means actually hearing the risks, benefits, and alternatives out loud before you agree — not assuming they were covered because a form was signed.",
   howTo:"Before consenting to a real procedure or treatment, explicitly ask about the risks, the expected benefit, and what the alternatives (including doing nothing) are.",
